# A land unit steps from the shore onto an own ship at sea and boards it.
# Fixture (from colony_fence_to_jobs): lone Scout #95 (type 5) moved to the forest shore (47,25), no orders, full
# moves, selected (head.active_unit, cursor stuff.x/y); empty Caravel #2 (was a goto ship with goods at (47,29))
# moved to open sea at (48,25), no orders, full moves, holds_occupied 0 (free capacity). French goto units
# (orders 3) sentried so nothing auto-walks.
key KP_6                   # step east onto the ship's sea tile: the Scout boards (sentried, moves spent, chained under the
                           # ship), and the ship becomes the selection (view scrolls to it)
wait 20
